RenPyLinter: backport SDL #16355 scene orientation support to SDL 2.0.20.
Upstream: https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/commit/114aca1727c755104ecfbd3bf4db986e0ff483e2
Local adaptation: use actual UIWindow bounds without orientation correction;
never treat Unknown as portrait. Preserve RenPy MetalANGLE integration.

